# Contoh secret Edge Functions. Isi lewat Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets
# (atau `supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/functions/.env`). Jangan commit .env asli.
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, dan SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY sudah disediakan otomatis oleh Supabase.

# Wajib: kunci Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey). Kunci cadangan: GEMINI_API_KEY_2, dst.
GEMINI_API_KEY=isi-kunci-gemini

# Opsional: daftar model chat dipisah koma (dicoba berurutan)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite,gemini-3.1-flash-lite,gemini-3.8-flash
# Opsional: model dan suara text-to-speech
# GEMINI_TTS_FAST_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts
# GEMINI_TTS_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash-tts
# GEMINI_TTS_VOICE=Sulafat
